# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_6001187> (Decreased circulating progranulin concentration)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_6001187> "The concentration of progranulin in the blood circulation is below the lower limit of normal.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000233> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_6001187> <https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/10918>)
