AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_6001438> "Tenosynovitis can be ascertained as hypoechoic or anechoic thickened tissue with or without fluid within the tendon sheath, which is seen in 2 perpendicular planes and which may exhibit Doppler signal.")
